      children: "Industrial IoT sensors generate millions of data points per day → temperature, vibration, pressure, RPM, energy consumption, and dozens of other metrics. The IoTDataIngestionAgent handles the ingestion pipeline: parsing raw sensor payloads, validating against thresholds, detecting statistical anomalies, and routing alerts to the appropriate teams."
