      children: "Production scheduling is a constrained optimization problem: assign production orders to machines and time slots while respecting capacity limits, material availability, maintenance windows, and delivery deadlines. A ProductionSchedulingAgent applies heuristic optimization to generate feasible schedules and reschedules dynamically when disruptions occur."
